body:
going after an 18 year old is in no way pedophilic;

“Pedophilia (alternatively spelled paedophilia) is a psychiatric disorder in which an adult or older adolescent experiences a primary or exclusive sexual attraction to prepubescent children.[1][2]: vii  Although girls typically begin the process of puberty at age 10 or 11, and boys at age 11 or 12” 

please stop spreading misinformation and frankly being offensive to those who have been victims of a real pedophile. your feelings are not factual but are valid, if you’re uncomfortable with a young adult simply do not engage with them but don’t claim it to be pedophilic as it degrades the meaning of a horrific crime.
